Package: datagrade
Type: Package
Title: Scored Data Quality Assessment for Open Data Sets
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Omer Haluk", "Demirhan", email = "hlk01dn@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A single-call data quality assessment that scores a data set on the
    ISO/IEC 25024 dimensions of completeness, accuracy, consistency and
    timeliness. Reports missing-data patterns, duplicates, redundant columns,
    outliers, multicollinearity and distributional deviations, and returns a
    structured object with plots rather than console text alone. The scoring
    framework implements the methodology of the author's MSc dissertation,
    "Assessing Data Quality Management Issues in Open-Sourced Data Sets with
    Statistical Methodology" (University of Greenwich, 2024).
